OL,4,Aphoto contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FXu did not respond to the BBC's request
OL,7,Ffor comment, but has posted online
OL,8,Fdenying he broke the competition rules.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
