OL,3,ADame Esther Rantzen: That's Life!
OL,4,Apresenter, Childline founder and
OL,5,Acampaigner for assisted dying
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe later became a renowned campaigner
OL,8,Ffor older people and, in the last years
OL,9,Fof her life, for the legalisation of
OL,10,Fmedically-assisted death.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
